    {
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Top 10 least reliable flight numbers",
      "description": "Flight numbers with the most carrier cancellations (code A) per 1,000 flights, among those with at least the minimum number of completed flights; ties go to the one with more carrier delay per flight. Airlines reuse a number on several routes over time: the label shows the route it flew most, and the tooltip how many it flew.",
